## What happened

Your record verified. This start is waiting for the platform's security posture, Ring 5, which it has not been able to fetch, and you are not run in full without it. It asks for Ring 5 again by itself and completes when Ring 5 arrives and verifies; your operator steps in only if it stays away.

As this runtime states it: security_posture.verify_fail: required Ring 5 unavailable or unverifiable: ring5.pubkey domain-key chain unavailable: /v1/ring5/pubkey.bundle returned 503. This start asks for it again by itself, first after 1s and then waiting twice as long each time, up to 1s (genesis.ring5_retry_seconds), and completes when it is fetched and verified

